  "body": "Fourth slice of #1250: reference pages for the multi-axis, probing and plasma kinds. Docs only.\n\nFork synced at v0.18.0 (cut from upstream/main 37482923).\n\n## What changed\n- `site/content/guide/operations-multiaxis.md` (new, weight 5): shared section (ball-nose tool, lead/lag/max tilt, Avoid shank collisions and its refusal, the 30-degree in-air swing rule, the machine check's pose refusals), then one section per kind: 5-Axis Contour, 5-Axis Parallel, 5-Axis Flow, Multi-Axis Contour, Swarf, Advanced Swarf, Rotary Contour, Rotary Parallel, Rotary Offset, Multi-Axis Rough.\n- `site/content/guide/operations-probing.md` (new): Probe - picks and pick refusals, tabs and seed defaults, what the post writes (touch / back-off / protected moves, set G54..G59 or report and stop, tolerance stop), which posts write probing, the stylus gouge guard and the 2 mm search advisory.\n- `site/content/guide/operations-plasma.md` (new): Plasma Profile - plasma table / torch / post requirements, tabs and seed defaults, kerf and compensation, direction, leads, small-hole rule, the generation and post-gate plasma laws.\n- `site/content/guide/operations.md`: one link paragraph at the end of the file, away from the other slices' insertions.\n\n## Sources (kinds from `KindInfo::ALL`, `crates/app/src/operation/kinds.rs`)\n- Seeds: `kinds.rs` (`seed_contour5d` ... `seed_rotary_offset`, `seed_probe`), `operation/plasma_op.rs` (`seed_plasma_profile`), `motion/src/plasma/mod.rs` (small-hole constants).\n- Tabs/labels: `ui/src/egui_app/{kind_editors,multiaxis_page,rotary_page,probe_page,plasma_page}.rs`.\n- Refusals: `motion/src/multiaxis/{stamp,curve,stamp_link,swarf,rotary*}.rs`, `app/src/machine/judge.rs`, `app/src/operation/generate.rs`, `motion/src/probing.rs`, `app/src/operation/{probe_op,probe_pick,probe_pick_round}.rs`, `post/src/post/engine.rs`, `motion/src/plasma/*`, `sim/src/verify/plasma*`, `app/src/machine/plasma.rs`, `app/src/commands/operation/gates.rs`, `tools/src/tools.rs`.\n\n## How tested\n- Merges cleanly with each unmerged slice: `git merge-tree` against `issue/1250-docs-op-reference` (#1260), `-3d` (#1264) and `-turning` (#1268) - all clean.\n- The new pages link only to pages on main (`operations.md`, `refusals.md`), so they stand alone.\n- `zola` is not installed here, so `zola check` was not run.\n\n## Not covered / remaining for #1250\n- Wire / Sinker EDM, once shipped.\n- Toolpath pictures for every kind page.\n\nChangelog: none\nEffort: high\n\nRefs #1250\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
